          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While this unit is in the battlefield, each time you use the Teleport Homer ability for any of your other units, you may instead use&apos;teleport beacon&apos;. If you do, Deploy that unit wholly within 2D6+2&quot; of and visible to this unit. Then, during this turn&apos;s Move step, do not make a Move Roll and the active unit cannot Advance or Reposition.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
