          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">During an Advance, this unit may move up to an additional 4&quot; and may move through enemy models as if they were not there, if that move would end within 2&quot; of two or more enemy units. If it does, until the End step, all enemy units within 2&quot; of this unit are considered to be within engagement range.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
