            <profile name="Hawk-Sighted Sentry" id="8adf-ceff-3ffd-f0d7" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit’s Move step, you may skip this turn&apos;s Attacks step. Then, if you did, once this battle round, after this unit gains Salvus Volley, this unit may make attacks targeting the active enemy unit (if able).</characteristic>
